            },
            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ivy’ ukugaburira abera sindinda kubibandikira. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuko nzi umutima ukunze wanyu, ni wo nirata mu Banyamakedoniya yuko muwufise, mvuga yukw Abanyakaya bāri basanzwe biteguye, uhereye mu mwaka ushize, kandi gushishikara kwanyu kwateye abenshi umwete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kandi ndungitse abo bene Data kugira ng’ ukwirata mwebge kwacu ntikuze gupfe ubusa mur’ ivyo; kugira ngo muze mube mwiteguye nk’uko nababgiye, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "twebge (sinovuga mwebge) ntituze tumāramāzwe n’ivyo twari twizigiye, namb’ Abanyamakedoniya bamwe bazozanana nanje bagasanga mutiteguye. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CO 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ni co gitumye niyumviriye yuko nkwiye kwinginga abo bene Data kunyitangira imbere mu kuza i wanyu, ngo babanze gutunganya ivy’ ubuntu mwasezeranye kera, bibe vyiteguwe nk’ivy’ ubuntu, ata kinubge.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CO.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CO.9.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
